  "remarks": "TAi.118 Title: Mullah. Designation: Head of Ariana Afghan Airlines under the Taliban regime (1996-2001). Passport no: Afghanistan diplomatic passport D0009721 ; issued 12 Oct. 2021; (Name in Latin script: Hamidullah Saeed; name in original script: حميدالله سعيد ; expires 12 Oct. 2026.) Belongs to Ghilzai tribe. Height: 175cm; Listing: Listed on 25 January 2001 (amended on 3 Sep 2003, 9 July 2007, 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov. 2011 and 13 Aug 2012, 10 Mar. 2026)",
